msgstr "機体のライト"

msgid "Aircraft lighting"
msgstr "機体の照明"

msgid "Aircraft show effects"
msgstr "機体のショー効果"

msgid "Reduce aircraft flashes"
msgstr "機体の点滅を減らす"

msgid "Restore lighting defaults"
msgstr "照明設定を初期値に戻す"

msgid ""
"Low keeps aircraft LEDs and landing lights. Standard adds nearby spill and "
